{"w":2400,"h":3390,"lines":[{"h":0.03343023339555673,"x":0.0082135492060518081,"w":0.30390144348144527,"y":0.0058139530576382104,"t":"@MirsIELTS","c":1},{"w":0.23273422241210939,"y":0.046028084429449723,"t":"Sample Writing answers","h":0.019472159326603955,"c":1,"x":0.67512886480870593},{"c":1,"x":0.069611129057029764,"w":0.35969235738118488,"h":0.02379296676950815,"y":0.092485563152185257,"t":"TEST 1, WRITING TASK 2"},{"x":0.069815197845596755,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.0 score.","y":0.13067846602083588,"c":1,"w":0.69199178059895838,"h":0.016224188790560534},{"x":0.067761813791101036,"y":0.15840707977249746,"h":0.020371990147593388,"w":0.81519505818684901,"c":1,"t":"In my opinion competition at work, at school and in daily life can both be a good thing and a bad"},{"h":0.021853874003992635,"x":0.06974813280085726,"t":"thing. Why? because I think too much of anything can be destructive. Yes, it's a very good thing to","y":0.17734148938661576,"c":1,"w":0.81941884358723949},{"c":1,"y":0.19769036783305372,"h":0.021814229284415898,"t":"be competitive but don't overdo it! Having no competition in your life at all can be very depressing,","x":0.069748182784466428,"w":0.82559590657552073},{"y":0.22093023305276049,"w":0.76180699666341156,"h":0.018895347842776355,"x":0.069815187395272649,"c":1,"t":"because you have no motivation, no goals you want to achieve, everytime you wake up in the"},{"c":1,"x":0.069815208115805938,"y":0.23834808210665437,"t":"morning. I don't believe that there is such thing as \"co-operating\" too much, when you work with","h":0.021828908554572313,"w":0.80903488159179693},{"c":1,"h":0.018903066134382529,"x":0.067761794731904204,"t":"someone you should work together as a team and co-operate, but also do things for yourself, like","y":0.26162790747083231,"w":0.81724848429361974},{"y":0.28197674466226808,"h":0.018908210911933732,"w":0.83162216186523441,"c":1,"t":"something career-wise. You should think of your future in your work. That goes the same if you are","x":0.067761814027455791},{"t":"still in school, take my school life for example. If I am very good at one subject in particular, lots of","y":0.30232558123068309,"c":1,"w":0.83367558797200525,"x":0.067761795219042825,"h":0.02038828306845164},{"w":0.82546203613281244,"x":0.069815183060008501,"t":"other student may come up to me and ask for pointers. I would be very glad to help them. If there","y":0.324127907471494,"h":0.018939939290724572,"c":1},{"y":0.34302325545344936,"w":0.82751536051432284,"h":0.02039857374883336,"c":1,"x":0.067761830769532502,"t":"is any homework, school mates may come over to do it together. this is also fine and very good for"},{"t":"building relationship. But sometimes there are people who think you are so nice and ask you to","y":0.36482558188980274,"x":0.069815194850949072,"h":0.018950228845827088,"c":1,"w":0.79671457926432288},{"t":"do their work for them. This is where you should draw the line, yes you are friends and you should","x":0.067761813980818986,"w":0.8234086100260416,"h":0.018955374748657605,"y":0.38517441909949979,"c":1},{"y":0.40552325630711517,"h":0.018960519526208808,"x":0.067761806966330482,"c":1,"t":"help each other, but that doesn't mean that you have to do their homework or give them answer","w":0.80492813110351558},{"c":1,"x":0.067684539269796312,"y":0.42551581080978207,"w":0.55250396728515616,"h":0.022178980734495979,"t":"when there is a test. Remember life is a competition, be a winner."},{"w":0.31211496988932291,"h":0.014534883302221635,"y":0.46220930235324964,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","x":0.069815205969096225,"c":1},{"w":0.71663243611653638,"c":1,"h":0.016009810118548629,"t":"This response covers the task and is engaging to read. The candidate starts","x":0.11498973662910733,"y":0.49852507348152131},{"w":0.74141052246093742,"h":0.02023157215399729,"c":1,"t":"by saying competition can be good and bad, too much can be [destructive] and","x":0.11491998288932877,"y":0.51551991258522634},{"x":0.1149897369232455,"w":0.72484598795572908,"c":1,"t":"too little can be [depressing] as you would have [no motivation, no goals]. No","h":0.017517321651312479,"y":0.53480825971533918},{"x":0.11498974491747371,"t":"specific examples are given, and they would improve the response. The rest of the","c":1,"y":0.55221238956112817,"h":0.017699115044247815,"w":0.77618067423502601},{"x":0.11285296642932603,"w":0.75993077596028646,"c":1,"h":0.021250415903277142,"t":"response addresses 'cooperation' but is mostly about how people can cooperate","y":0.56714389242197782},{"c":1,"x":0.11293633779581351,"y":0.58575581444405156,"w":0.77823410034179685,"h":0.018963949377909461,"t":"rather than comparing 'cooperation' with 'competition' in line with the question. The"},{"y":0.60610465127807744,"c":1,"t":"conclusion [. .. be a winner] slightly contradicts the earlier point [\/ don't believe that","h":0.016019242773365416,"x":0.11498974517103931,"w":0.78439422607421871},{"c":1,"w":0.46406570434570321,"y":0.62209302373871589,"t":"there is such a thing as \"co-operating\" too much].","x":0.11498973508680872,"h":0.018909925837783947},{"h":0.017550764955953868,"x":0.11704311937795675,"t":"Unfortunately, there is no paragraphing to group ideas together or indicate main","y":0.6525073745502401,"w":0.74743326822916667,"c":1},{"y":0.66991150439397074,"w":0.54620122273763017,"h":0.017699115044247815,"t":"topics. This affects the rating for coherence and cohesion.","c":1,"x":0.11498973763070429},{"t":"There is some higher-level vocabulary [destructive | motivation | career-wise] with","w":0.76602584838867183,"y":0.7004399195417198,"h":0.018457957354970356,"c":1,"x":0.11492612906989071},{"h":0.015996089586466145,"c":1,"y":0.71946902657224632,"t":"some idiomatic use [draw the line] which makes vocabulary the strongest area","x":0.11498974361116562,"w":0.73511291503906251},{"t":"in this response. A wider range would be needed for a higher score. There is a","y":0.73687315641829731,"x":0.11293633651096475,"h":0.016033820205733407,"c":1,"w":0.73716634114583324},{"y":0.75427728608014122,"w":0.72689936319986981,"t":"range of grammatical structures, including comparative forms and conditional","x":0.11498974335222253,"h":0.018978527372917275,"c":1},{"w":0.13347023010253911,"y":0.77315634224144958,"x":0.11293634256960035,"h":0.014749262536873142,"c":1,"t":"[if] structures."},{"t":"Although they do address the task and present relevant ideas, to achieve a","w":0.70636550903320316,"h":0.017441860412777621,"c":1,"x":0.11498972997222134,"y":0.80232558141876698},{"x":0.11498972456830217,"w":0.73716634114583335,"c":1,"h":0.017445290264478497,"t":"higher score, the candidate should organise the response into paragraphs and","y":0.81976401203164262},{"x":0.11498972537458314,"c":1,"w":0.76180699666341145,"y":0.83716814131488859,"h":0.017483021446385583,"t":"discuss both views. They could also demonstrate a greater level of accuracy with"},{"t":"vocabulary and grammatical structures.","h":0.016045825249325962,"c":1,"w":0.38193018595377604,"y":0.85604719788139205,"x":0.11293634426290623},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"t":"129","x":0.86447638552583173,"y":0.92296511654154179,"w":0.036960986455281564},{"t":"IELTSXpress.com","y":0.94166666658950615,"w":0.45294118245442705,"x":0.51176470218237247,"h":0.04166666666666663,"c":1}]}